{
  "id": "drowned-bell-saltmere",
  "title": "The Drowned Bell of Saltmere",
  "description": "<p>A D&amp;D 5e (2014 rules) one-shot for four to five level 5 characters. Coastal folk horror, mystery and a moral choice: a drowned bell rings beneath the waves at every low tide, and each time it does, someone walks into the sea smiling.</p><p>Four scenes with walls, lights, sound and map pins; all NPCs and monsters; handouts; roll tables; playlists; and the Saltmere Tracker for the Tide Track and the bell's True Tolls.</p>",
